 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? That's exciting and a bit overwhelming all at once. Do you want lead her tour, or would you rather have someone else guide her? No problem. That's it. Go in and get her prescription, and she can pay later. It depends on how long it' been since you last filled it. Then it should be under your full name, with the initials as the middle. Let her lead the tour, she'll remember the details best. Just follow her at a good pace. Starting to walk slowly as a group is worth her peace of mind. Pick up the pace once she' used to the buildings.",
